   <button class="mode-card" data-mode="30-day" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mode-tag">长线挑战</span><strong>30<small>天</small></strong><span class="mode-name">深水历练</span><span class="mode-description">更长的旅程，面对每一天的上供。</span><span class="mode-check">选择模式 ↗</span></button>
